{
    "key": "services-recurring",
    "templateKey": "repobot-services-recurring",
    "title": "Cleaning & recurring services",
    "description": "A subscription-trade site: pricing plans on the home page, a live open/closed badge, a line-by-line what's-included comparison, a proof gallery with a lightbox, and a booking form that asks for a frequency \u2014 a multi-page site edited in one content file.",
    "marketingExampleTitle": "Recurring service business",
    "category": "services",
    "homePath": "/",
    "previewPath": "/cleaning",
    "homeViewDir": "web/app/src/View/ServicesRecurring",
    "base": "landing",
    "clientOnly": true,
    "capabilities": ["IOS", "ANDROID"],
    "isDefault": false,
    "forms": {
        "$comment": "Managed-form kinds, formKey -> kind (append-only vocabulary: RSVP | LEAD | MAILING_LIST | PROOFING). Compose stamps these into repobot.deploy.json as formKinds; the dashboard renders declared kinds as typed views and keeps the raw Inbox for undeclared keys.",
        "booking-request": "LEAD"
    },
    "theme": {
        "$comment": "The warm-boutique register's brand overlay: a fresh herbal green over the register's cream warmth \u2014 the clean-and-natural voice for a home-services subscription, deliberately apart from the trades register the category's other starters wear. Marketing pages resolve brand over preset accent, so the overlay re-skins the pages and the app surfaces together.",
        "brand": { "primary": "#2f7a52", "primaryDark": "#8fd6ae" }
    },
    "contentContract": {
        "$comment": "The pack's content slots, as data (packs/README.md 'Content contract'). Declares what a composer (agent or tool) must bind for a generated variant of this pack to present as real: slot paths into the typed content module, their kinds, and minimums. The demo business is a home cleaner, but the slots are trade-agnostic \u2014 lawn care, pool service, or pest control binds the same shape. Authored alongside the module and guarded by the pack's content tests \u2014 the module satisfies the contract; the contract never drifts ahead of it.",
        "module": "web/app/src/View/ServicesRecurring/content.ts",
        "slots": {
            "business.name": { "kind": "text" },
            "business.tagline": { "kind": "text" },
            "business.location": { "kind": "text" },
            "business.phone": { "kind": "text" },
            "business.email": { "kind": "text" },
            "business.address": { "kind": "text" },
            "business.license": { "kind": "text" },
            "home.headline": { "kind": "text" },
            "home.subheadline": { "kind": "text" },
            "home.heroImage": { "kind": "media" },
            "plans": {
                "kind": "collection",
                "min": 2,
                "item": {
                    "name": { "kind": "text" },
                    "perVisit": { "kind": "text" },
                    "description": { "kind": "text" },
                    "features": { "kind": "text[]" }
                }
            },
            "included": {
                "kind": "collection",
                "min": 4,
                "item": {
                    "title": { "kind": "text" },
                    "description": { "kind": "text" }
                }
            },
            "gallery": {
                "kind": "collection",
                "min": 2,
                "item": {
                    "caption": { "kind": "text" },
                    "image": { "kind": "media" }
                }
            },
            "metrics": {
                "kind": "collection",
                "min": 2,
                "item": {
                    "value": { "kind": "text" },
                    "label": { "kind": "text" }
                }
            },
            "testimonials": {
                "kind": "collection",
                "min": 2,
                "item": {
                    "quote": { "kind": "text" },
                    "name": { "kind": "text" },
                    "detail": { "kind": "text" }
                }
            },
            "serviceArea": { "kind": "text[]", "min": 1 },
            "faq": {
                "kind": "collection",
                "min": 3,
                "item": {
                    "question": { "kind": "text" },
                    "answer": { "kind": "text" }
                }
            },
            "about.headline": { "kind": "text" },
            "about.photo": { "kind": "media" },
            "about.paragraphs": { "kind": "text[]", "min": 2 },
            "about.credentials": { "kind": "text[]", "min": 1 },
            "book.headline": { "kind": "text" },
            "book.body": { "kind": "text" }
        }
    },
    "landing": {
        "$comment": "Doc-aware pack pages: routes maps each pack route to the page id its config merges under (web/app/src/View/ServicesRecurring/ServicesRecurringPage.tsx, useSitePageConfig). pages seeds each page's layout skeleton \u2014 ids match servicesRecurringLanding.ts; the platform's structural editor edits these. The preset is warm-boutique (cream-and-terracotta local-business warmth) with the catalog's herbal-green brand overlay \u2014 the clean-and-natural voice.",
        "style": { "preset": "warm-boutique" },
        "routes": {
            "/": "home",
            "/plans": "plans",
            "/about": "about",
            "/book": "book"
        },
        "pages": {
